  "text": "Since.dev: Reviews, Pricing and Alternatives | Uneed\nLaunchpad\nCommunity\nPricing\nProducts\nMore\nSince.dev\nSelf-repairing software for a world that never stops changing.\nVisit website\nSave\n37 Upvotes\nOverview\nReviews\nRewards\nDeals\nSince.dev\nis building self-repairing software for a world that never stops changing.\nModern software depends on APIs, SDKs, packages, and AI models that evolve independently of your code. A service changes its behavior, an endpoint disappears, a model gets retired—and software that worked yesterday can fail without a single commit.\nWe close the gap between what changed outside your code and what needs to change inside it. Since monitors external dependencies, assesses their impact on your repository, and prepares targeted repairs as draft pull requests. Your existing CI checks the changes, and your team decides what ships.\nFor AI agents, Since delivers the same change evidence through API, MCP, and webhooks, helping them work from current information instead of outdated assumptions.\nOur mission is to make adapting to change a built-in capability of software, so keeping it working takes less human intervention.\nAbout Since.dev\nSince.dev is\na\ndevelopment\nproduct\nlisted on Uneed, with a free tier and paid plans.\nIt's tagged with\nCI CD\n,\nTesting\n.\nSee the\nbest CI CD products\nfor related options.\nFrequently asked questions about Since.dev\nWhat is Since.dev?\nSince.dev is self-repairing software for a world that never stops changing.\nIs Since.dev free?\nSince.dev offers a free tier with paid plans available for additional features.\nWhat are alternatives to Since.dev?\nDiscover similar ci cd, testing, api & data products in the Uneed directory.\nWhat category does Since.dev belong to?\nSince.dev is listed under Development on Uneed.\nUser reviews\nNo reviews yet\nBe the first to review Since.dev and help other makers discover it.\nLog in to leave a review\nThis product has no rewards yet.\nThis produ